title: smirking_behemoth_victory_npc
---
The Rope Appreciator: Oh wow. I'm OUT. I had started naming its stomach noises.
<<if cut_rope_heavy_object_is("piano")>>
    The Rope Appreciator: You cut the rope and dropped a piano on it. I saw the whole thing.
    The Rope Appreciator: A piano. You killed it with a piano. I have no notes.
<<else>>
    The Rope Appreciator: You cut the rope and dropped an anvil on it. I saw the whole thing.
    The Rope Appreciator: An anvil. You killed it with an anvil. Good.
<<endif>>
The Rope Appreciator: How are you going to spend the rest of your day?
-> Maybe watch a video.
    The Rope Appreciator: Here. Watch this: youtube.com/watch?v=ucLGm27DDL0
    <<watch_cut_rope_video>>
-> Press reset and start again.
    The Rope Appreciator: Fine by me. Hit it. I'm staying out here this time.
    <<reset_cut_rope_room>>
-> Just walk away.
    The Rope Appreciator: Works for me. I'm going to stand here for a while.
===
